# Docker build context filter for Dockerfile.kernel and Dockerfile.shell.
#
# Both builds `COPY . .` the workspace into a builder stage, so anything not
# listed here lands in an image layer. Keep secrets and local state out of the
# context entirely; they must reach the kernel at runtime (compose bind mounts
# and env_file), never at build time.

# Build output and local state
**/target
data
.codegraph

# Secrets and local deployment config (the *.example.yaml files are not needed
# by the build either; compose mounts openspine.yaml at runtime)
.env
.env.*
*.env
openspine*.yaml
*.key
*.pem

# VCS, CI, editor/agent tooling
.git
.github
.omp
.agents
.DS_Store

# Node tooling and the docs site: not Cargo workspace members
node_modules
site
